---
description: Require tests for behavior changes before calling the work done
alwaysApply: true
---

Behavior changes need tests in the same PR. Do not call the work done without them.

Follow `/recording-studio-tests` for suites, procedure, and the ~94% working coverage bar (gem suite under `test/` plus dummy under `test/dummy/test/`).

Prefer meaningful coverage of changed behavior over chasing the number. Never delete, stub out, or bypass production code to inflate coverage.

Green CI is not enough if the change did not add or update tests for the new behavior.

UI still needs `verify-ui` browser verification and screenshots. Tests do not replace that.

Upgrade and behavior changes still need the upgrade tests in `gem-version-and-release.mdc`.
